      "message": "ViewPropertyAnimator being in the android.view package, I assumed it is not meant to be used outside of the UI Thread.\n\nCan you elaborate on this, please? A ThreadLocal\u003cValueAnimator\u003e may be a better idea in case ViewPropertyAnimator can be used from everywhere.",
